{"4529950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Titanic Survival Simulator", "steam_appid": 4529950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >April, 1912. A calm night in the Atlantic. The most luxurious ship in the world glides through the water… until everything changes.<br><br>In Titanic Survival Simulator, you are not a hero, just one of many passengers trying to survive the most famous maritime disaster in history. The impact is sudden. Panic spreads. Water begins to rise. And there are not enough lifeboats for everyone 🌊<br><br>⏳ Race Against Time<br>The ship is sinking, and every minute matters. Navigate through corridors, stairways, and cabins before they are swallowed by water.<br><br>🧭 Explore a Dying Ship<br>Move through detailed interiors as the environment changes around you: tilted floors, flooded rooms, and blocked paths force you to constantly adapt.<br><br>❄️ Survive the Cold<br>Freezing water, exhaustion, and limited resources push your survival to the limit. Manage your stamina and avoid hypothermia at all costs.<br><br>⚖️ Moral Choices<br>Help others and risk your own survival, or focus only on yourself. Every decision affects your chances of making it out alive.<br><br>🛟 Fight for Survival<br>Lifeboats are limited. Chaos is everywhere. Reaching safety is never guaranteed.<br><br>In Titanic Survival Simulator, there are no second chances, only the choices you make in the final moments. Will you survive… or go down with the ship? 🌊</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >April, 1912. A calm night in the Atlantic. The most luxurious ship in the world glides through the water… until everything changes.<br><br>In Titanic Survival Simulator, you are not a hero, just one of many passengers trying to survive the most famous maritime disaster in history. The impact is sudden. Panic spreads. Water begins to rise. And there are not enough lifeboats for everyone 🌊<br><br>⏳ Race Against Time<br>The ship is sinking, and every minute matters. Navigate through corridors, stairways, and cabins before they are swallowed by water.<br><br>🧭 Explore a Dying Ship<br>Move through detailed interiors as the environment changes around you: tilted floors, flooded rooms, and blocked paths force you to constantly adapt.<br><br>❄️ Survive the Cold<br>Freezing water, exhaustion, and limited resources push your survival to the limit. Manage your stamina and avoid hypothermia at all costs.<br><br>⚖️ Moral Choices<br>Help others and risk your own survival, or focus only on yourself. Every decision affects your chances of making it out alive.<br><br>🛟 Fight for Survival<br>Lifeboats are limited. Chaos is everywhere. Reaching safety is never guaranteed.<br><br>In Titanic Survival Simulator, there are no second chances, only the choices you make in the final moments. Will you survive… or go down with the ship? 🌊</p>", "short_description": "Survive the final hours of the Titanic Survival Simulator. Escape the sinking ship, navigate flooding corridors, manage cold and stamina, and make life-or-death choices as you race for a place on the last lifeboats.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529950/ac091eea645289cae2679cfce70d7918c85a69f8/header.jpg?t=1774276781", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529950/13bba57f53b470d888716655f4f4282adb7e3503/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774276781", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529950/13bba57f53b470d888716655f4f4282adb7e3503/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774276781", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> G